# Build outputs.
/target/
result
result-*

# direnv's materialized profile. The `.envrc` is tracked; what it builds is not.
/.direnv/

# Coverage artifacts. `cargo llvm-cov` drops these beside the manifest.
*.profraw
*.profdata

# The private-name denylist is itself the list of names that must not be
# published (`scripts/guard:V23`), so it is the one file that may never be
# tracked. The guard reads it from here.
/.private-names

# Local agent state (Claude Code worktrees, scratch): never part of the tree.
/.claude/
